WEBVTT

00:25.540 --> 00:26.520
Here’s the lighttime!

00:26.700 --> 00:28.680
Will you guys click the follow button?

00:28.680 --> 00:29.210
Come on!

00:30.320 --> 00:31.540
Lu Guang, say something!

00:33.300 --> 00:35.080
Follow us, please!

00:37.110 --> 00:38.600
My Mom is always beaten by him

00:39.640 --> 00:42.860
But next day, they would 
pretend as if nothing happened

00:43.040 --> 00:43.730
How about you

00:44.300 --> 00:45.470
What were you doing

00:46.020 --> 00:47.570
He always asked me to bring my little sister

00:48.300 --> 00:49.750
into the bedroom.

00:49.750 --> 00:50.640
And then hide?

00:52.000 --> 00:53.280
Don't be embarrassed.

00:53.420 --> 00:54.320
You did the right thing.

00:54.840 --> 00:56.610
Your mother would also want you to do this.

00:57.070 --> 00:59.660
This is her rule to survive until now.

01:00.530 --> 01:02.740
We are like animals living in a jungle.

01:03.410 --> 01:05.950
Some are born to be eaten by others.

01:06.690 --> 01:09.410
I said I hate people like him the most.

01:09.490 --> 01:11.460
Well, then don’t be too noisy.

01:11.880 --> 01:13.130
Otherwise, I'll call the police.

01:13.130 --> 01:14.780
Some of them are afraid of being eaten

01:15.300 --> 01:18.190
so they choose to hide 
and doge all their life

01:19.470 --> 01:21.400
What’s wrong with these guys?

01:23.220 --> 01:24.810
Why did this coward

01:25.000 --> 01:26.990
want to be a hero today?

01:26.990 --> 01:31.550
You even seduced this kind 
of scum, didn’t you?

01:30.270 --> 01:31.580
I beg you. Leave us alone.

01:31.550 --> 01:32.710
You’re a disgrace!

01:32.690 --> 01:34.550
Let’s divorce, OK?

01:35.180 --> 01:36.250
Let’s divorce!

01:36.250 --> 01:37.540
Divorce?

01:37.540 --> 01:39.460
Doesn't that just let you have your way

01:39.460 --> 01:43.650
And I, Li Fan, will be a joke 
for the rest of my life!

01:43.650 --> 01:45.220
Don't even dream about it

01:45.220 --> 01:47.300
I’ll never agree even if I die!

01:52.150 --> 01:54.540
Some are born as bloodthirsty beasts,

01:55.830 --> 01:58.900
And some are special and evolving

02:00.920 --> 02:02.690
They keep growing
and evolving

02:03.030 --> 02:04.650
They keep growing

02:07.220 --> 02:09.450
Eventually, they become

02:10.060 --> 02:11.570
one of the few hunters

02:13.110 --> 02:14.810
in this jungle.

02:18.810 --> 02:22.880
Which one do you want to be in the future?

04:23.220 --> 04:25.160
Tianchen! Tianchen!

04:27.120 --> 04:30.060
Li Fan! Are you still a man!

04:32.170 --> 04:35.110
I, I just wanna scare you

04:35.920 --> 04:37.880
I didn't expect that he’d rush at me.

04:38.120 --> 04:40.460
Tianchen, Tianchen!

04:42.040 --> 04:43.210
I'm fine.

04:47.090 --> 04:48.720
Liu Lan, Liu Lan.

04:49.550 --> 04:51.620
This mess is all your fault!

04:51.830 --> 04:54.700
You've forced me into this step by step.

05:03.880 --> 05:04.850
Look at this photo

05:05.740 --> 05:07.320
Who took this photo for you?

05:07.720 --> 05:10.240
I almost sacrifice my life for this family,

05:10.710 --> 05:12.980
but you all secretly live a comfortable life!

05:13.330 --> 05:16.240
Li Fan, you're already crazy.

05:17.020 --> 05:20.010
Xixi and I took this photo by ourselves.

05:20.790 --> 05:22.100
You're still lying!

05:22.370 --> 05:24.370
You keep lying to me over and over

05:24.370 --> 05:26.020
How can I believe you?

05:27.780 --> 05:29.410
Come here!

05:29.410 --> 05:30.140
Let me go! Let go of me!

05:30.140 --> 05:31.530
You liar!

05:31.810 --> 05:32.610
Cheng Xiaoshi, pick up the photo.

05:34.060 --> 05:36.690
What I should do now

05:37.090 --> 05:38.210
is to save her, isn’t it?

05:38.600 --> 05:39.800
Liar, liar

05:40.050 --> 05:41.640
If the photo is gone

05:42.920 --> 05:44.170
the ‘future’, our present, 
will no longer exist.

05:44.620 --> 05:46.600
Dare you lie to me again!

05:55.660 --> 05:57.470
Dare you keep flirting with other men!

05:59.200 --> 06:01.560
Give me this damn photo

06:02.860 --> 06:03.800
What are you doing!
Give me this damn photo

06:04.230 --> 06:05.460
Give me this damn photo

06:05.620 --> 06:06.630
I'm gonna tear it up!

06:11.600 --> 06:13.370
You also bribed the kids?

06:14.060 --> 06:17.560
I have sacrificed a lot for 
you over these damn years!

06:24.690 --> 06:25.660
Sorry.

06:26.600 --> 06:28.390
If I could have foreseen everything,

06:28.740 --> 06:30.730
I wouldn't have let you experience this pain.

06:40.380 --> 06:41.510
Tell me,

06:43.720 --> 06:44.640
dare you

06:45.880 --> 06:46.910
lie to me again,

06:47.110 --> 06:48.340
dare you cheat again?

06:51.090 --> 06:57.560
Xixi, do you remember the bedtime story

06:57.920 --> 07:00.820
Mom used to tell us every 
night when we were young?

07:02.340 --> 07:04.280
In a big forest,

07:05.000 --> 07:06.750
there was a small canbin.

07:08.250 --> 07:10.250
In the wooden house lived a family.

07:11.060 --> 07:16.940
A father, a mother, and a pair of siblings

07:18.850 --> 07:21.570
lived happily together.

07:25.690 --> 07:26.680
One day,

07:27.780 --> 07:31.020
the brother took his younger sister 
to the forest to collect berries,

07:31.960 --> 07:34.740
but as they walked, night fell.

07:36.040 --> 07:37.520
They got lost,

07:38.130 --> 07:40.340
and the sister was very scared.

07:41.730 --> 07:45.780
They met two crows who could speak

07:46.850 --> 07:48.730
and wanted to ask them for directions.

07:51.200 --> 07:54.840
But the two crows laughed at them.

07:55.800 --> 08:00.560
Out of anger, the brother used 
a stone to kill one of them,

08:02.320 --> 08:06.300
and the other one flew away in fright.

08:08.490 --> 08:10.360
The brother chased it,

08:11.150 --> 08:13.250
running and running.

08:14.380 --> 08:16.500
running and running.

08:17.300 --> 08:18.680
He ran for who knows how long.

08:23.440 --> 08:25.710
OK, Xixi, be a good girl.

08:26.250 --> 08:27.320
Your brother is almost asleep.

08:28.440 --> 08:29.330
You should go to sleep too.

08:29.890 --> 08:32.220
Mom, in the end of the story

08:32.810 --> 08:34.920
Did the siblings find their way home?

08:59.680 --> 09:00.560
Still cry, huh?

09:05.960 --> 09:07.950
Hello, hello, I wanna report a crime.

09:08.370 --> 09:09.410
Someone's gonna die!

09:09.720 --> 09:13.730
The address is Room 607, No. 
48, Tongli Lane, Nande District

09:13.890 --> 09:15.440
There's a big fight going on

09:15.540 --> 09:16.860
Hurry up

09:17.530 --> 09:19.750
You dare to kick me? You want to rebel

09:20.020 --> 09:20.810
Don’t you!

09:21.860 --> 09:22.780
Cheng Xiaoshi？

09:23.140 --> 09:24.820
Your good days are over.

09:25.240 --> 09:27.420
I’m gonna kill you all!

09:29.500 --> 09:32.660
Just wait, just you wait

09:35.280 --> 09:36.550
Bitch

09:38.380 --> 09:39.280
Cheng Xiaoshi!

09:48.300 --> 09:48.800
Cheng Xiaoshi?

09:51.400 --> 09:51.950
Over?

09:53.390 --> 09:54.320
What did you just do?

09:54.790 --> 09:56.020
Why did you completely lose contact?

09:56.490 --> 09:57.570
I don't know what happened,

09:58.160 --> 09:59.730
I couldn't see or hear anything,

10:00.820 --> 10:01.360
and then...

10:03.800 --> 10:04.480
I came back.

10:05.030 --> 10:06.100
Are you saying that

10:06.340 --> 10:07.730
you didn't voluntarily exit the photo?

10:08.010 --> 10:10.070
I don't remember putting my palms together

10:10.710 --> 10:11.850
but before coming out,

10:12.070 --> 10:13.810
I could still see some vague scenes

10:15.730 --> 10:18.900
It's like I was in the body of Xixi's mother.

10:21.170 --> 10:22.030
It's too strange.

10:22.840 --> 10:24.940
This is also the first time 
I’ve had such an experience.

10:26.010 --> 10:26.570
I don't understand.

10:27.080 --> 10:29.180
What else have you discovered about the case?

10:29.530 --> 10:30.280
Try to recall

10:30.710 --> 10:31.930
and see if you missed any detail.

10:31.930 --> 10:33.970
Captain Xiao, I know you're anxious

10:33.970 --> 10:35.570
but can you let him take a break first?

10:36.260 --> 10:37.100
Sorry

10:37.420 --> 10:39.900
Let me summarize the current clues.

10:41.210 --> 10:44.540
We can confirm that the people in the 
photo are Liu Lan and her daughter.

10:44.640 --> 10:48.350
But Liu Lan and her husband Li 
Fan died at home on the same day.

10:48.900 --> 10:50.860
The person who reported the 
case was their neighbor, Deng.

10:51.260 --> 10:52.660
According to the informant,

10:52.750 --> 10:55.620
On that day, Liu Lan had a heated 
argument with her husband Li Fan,

10:55.620 --> 10:57.050
during which domestic violence occurred.

10:57.680 --> 10:59.230
During the fight

10:59.230 --> 11:01.400
Liu Lan hit Li Fan on the head 
with a hammer, causing his death.

11:02.040 --> 11:04.850
But Liu Lan also died on the spot due to 
heavy blood loss from a stab wound to the abdomen.

11:06.490 --> 11:09.200
It was judged that their son Li Tianchen

11:09.590 --> 11:11.210
and his twin sister Li 
Tianxi were also present.

11:12.590 --> 11:15.740
What I experienced in the photo 
was on the day of the case.

11:16.930 --> 11:18.980
However, Xixi's mother was 
being abused all that time,.

11:19.120 --> 11:20.730
and never fought back.

11:21.030 --> 11:23.260
Maybe she had the impulse to resist

11:23.260 --> 11:24.880
after you exited the photo.

11:25.060 --> 11:27.540
By the way, what happened 
to the children after that?

11:27.980 --> 11:29.400
It’s very likely that one of them

11:29.930 --> 11:31.580
gave Lu Guang the photo, right?

11:31.840 --> 11:34.530
Their files have not been 
found in the system,

11:34.920 --> 11:36.960
They seems to have 
disappeared after the crime

11:37.540 --> 11:41.410
There is an informant who claims 
to know everything about it.

11:41.580 --> 11:42.940
She’s waiting for you 
at the police station.

11:43.490 --> 11:44.280
Waiting for Me?

11:44.580 --> 11:46.290
She says she’ll only talk to you.

11:46.480 --> 11:47.510
I'll go there now.

11:48.120 --> 11:48.760
Take your time.

11:49.210 --> 11:50.760
I feel there’s something weird.

11:50.840 --> 11:51.880
Better be careful.

11:52.840 --> 11:54.340
We are in the police station.

11:54.340 --> 11:55.400
What could happen?

11:55.580 --> 11:56.430
Don’t worry.

11:56.730 --> 11:59.070
Qiao Ling, go with Cheng Xiaoshi

11:59.450 --> 11:59.940
keep an eye on him.

12:00.140 --> 12:00.520
OK.

12:01.030 --> 12:02.330
You should be careful too.

12:02.640 --> 12:04.400
The person who can control others is hiding

12:04.400 --> 12:05.850
We still have no idea where he is.

12:06.140 --> 12:06.540
OK.

12:06.620 --> 12:07.860
I'll arrange for someone 
to keep an eye on him.

12:08.970 --> 12:11.580
Cheng, I'll tell you some 
tips and precautions

12:11.580 --> 12:13.850
about conversations on the way there.

12:14.110 --> 12:14.730
OK

12:23.480 --> 12:24.930
We've tried many methods,

12:24.930 --> 12:26.460
but she just danced around the subject

12:26.760 --> 12:28.840
so nothing new up to now.

12:29.270 --> 12:31.040
We also searched her,

12:31.040 --> 12:32.090
but she didn't have anything on her,

12:32.090 --> 12:32.950
not even a phone.

12:33.600 --> 12:35.770
Also, her mask affects the identification.

12:36.210 --> 12:37.780
She's very cautious,

12:37.780 --> 12:40.940
asking us to remove all monitoring 
devices in the interrogation room

12:40.940 --> 12:42.050
She’ll not talk until then.

12:43.010 --> 12:45.450
So now we can only rely on you 
to bring in the listening device.

12:46.010 --> 12:47.760
Come on, let me see where to put it.

12:48.250 --> 12:50.230
Do I need to wear an earpiece or something

12:50.230 --> 12:51.590
to stay in contact with you?

12:52.000 --> 12:53.330
Even the smallest earpiece

12:53.530 --> 12:55.480
will be detected if she inspects carefully,

12:56.010 --> 12:57.640
which will make her suspicious.

12:58.730 --> 13:01.000
So remember the questioning 
techniques I taught you earlier.

13:01.170 --> 13:02.650
The rhythm is crucial.

13:02.780 --> 13:05.260
Who controls the rhythm 
controls the initiative.

13:05.260 --> 13:05.680
Got it!

13:05.680 --> 13:06.650
Come on!, Cheng Xiaoshi.

13:06.650 --> 13:08.530
You are the hope of us all now.

13:08.680 --> 13:10.680
Just a piece of cake. Wait for my victory!

13:25.190 --> 13:27.330
Hello, I'm Cheng Xiaoshi.

13:28.220 --> 13:29.180
May I have your name?

13:29.500 --> 13:30.240
Hello.

13:31.340 --> 13:32.750
My name is Li Tianxi.

13:33.460 --> 13:34.480
Li Tianxi?!

13:36.270 --> 13:37.420
Finally we met each other

13:38.580 --> 13:39.540
Nice to meet you

13:45.460 --> 13:47.790
First, hand over everything hidden on you!

13:50.080 --> 13:51.420
How could it be her?

13:51.750 --> 13:54.160
Wang, how much information 
do we have about her?

13:54.460 --> 13:55.910
I brought everything I could find.

14:04.320 --> 14:06.730
Apart from my phone, I’ve got nothing else.

14:07.280 --> 14:08.050
Really?

14:09.120 --> 14:10.470
Just to be cautious,

14:11.100 --> 14:12.680
I still wanna check it out.

14:29.170 --> 14:30.820
Well, forget it.

14:31.730 --> 14:33.670
The foundation of cooperation 
is mutual trust.

14:34.490 --> 14:37.080
I hope we can have a better start this time.

14:41.330 --> 14:42.060
Sorry,

14:42.210 --> 14:43.470
could you keep it for me temporarily?

14:49.390 --> 14:50.850
You just mentioned cooperation.

14:51.250 --> 14:52.800
Then could you tell me why you come

14:52.800 --> 14:54.210
and what you know?

14:54.410 --> 14:56.400
The foundation of the game is mutual trust,

14:56.920 --> 14:58.300
fairness, and equality.

14:59.100 --> 15:00.740
Did you forget this so soon?

15:01.010 --> 15:02.000
It’s you?!

15:04.970 --> 15:07.570
This is the punishment for 
your breach of the game rules.

15:09.200 --> 15:12.440
Now the game restarts

15:12.770 --> 15:15.320
She’s the one who controlled 
Qiao Ling and Liu Min

15:15.730 --> 15:17.170
Is she able to speak now?

15:17.550 --> 15:19.240
Why did you turn out like this?

15:19.630 --> 15:20.100
And?

15:20.100 --> 15:20.420
Wait

15:21.560 --> 15:24.170
you haven't asked about my background

15:24.700 --> 15:26.320
since you entered and knew my name

15:27.360 --> 15:28.240
Have you

15:29.330 --> 15:31.280
already known about my family background?

15:32.040 --> 15:33.440
Then I'm even more curious

15:33.440 --> 15:34.920
how did you find out?

15:35.550 --> 15:36.290
Oops,

15:37.200 --> 15:39.620
it's unclear whether she's 
the real Li Tianxi now.

15:42.650 --> 15:43.510
Then

15:43.790 --> 15:46.260
I can't mention anything about the photo,

15:47.600 --> 15:50.430
I have to use the police 
investigation to explain.

15:50.820 --> 15:52.400
You're lying.

15:53.830 --> 15:57.310
Looks like you haven't deeply 
reflected on cheating before.

16:00.030 --> 16:01.330
You can fool me.

16:02.220 --> 16:04.070
But you can't fool her!

16:04.800 --> 16:05.320
But...

16:06.160 --> 16:08.880
I still don't know

16:08.880 --> 16:10.080
what ability she used to see through my lies

16:10.260 --> 16:12.870
Cheng Xiaoshi, why do you keep silent?

16:13.690 --> 16:16.570
I learned about your past through a photo.

16:20.180 --> 16:21.890
You finally told the truth this time!

16:22.290 --> 16:22.900
Great!

16:23.720 --> 16:25.360
It shows that we are getting 
more and more in sync!

16:25.570 --> 16:26.960
To celebrate this moment,

16:27.270 --> 16:28.360
I wanna drink Coke!

16:29.970 --> 16:30.360
Iced!

16:33.240 --> 16:34.780
Here, three cans of iced Coke.

16:35.100 --> 16:36.400
Thank you

16:36.400 --> 16:37.150
Sorry to trouble you again.

16:44.610 --> 16:47.180
How can a girl burp more rudely than men?

16:49.790 --> 16:50.860
Indeed, it's the "Water of Joy"

16:51.460 --> 16:52.570
After drinking it, I feel much better.

16:52.620 --> 16:53.150
By the way,

16:53.700 --> 16:55.420
why do you always wear a mask?

16:58.530 --> 17:00.570
Oh, no a big deal

17:00.790 --> 17:03.550
Just curious. It’s quite stuffy here.

17:03.770 --> 17:05.440
Wearing a mask may make you uncomfortable.

17:05.900 --> 17:08.780
I'm not sick. I've never been sick.

17:10.020 --> 17:11.670
Since I was a child,

17:12.690 --> 17:13.780
I don't know why,

17:15.040 --> 17:18.350
I can hear and see things that 
are more subtle than others.

17:19.770 --> 17:22.280
A light breeze sounds like crying in my ears.

17:23.980 --> 17:25.330
A puppy's bark

17:26.080 --> 17:28.110
sounds like a wild beast roaring.

17:29.370 --> 17:30.630
Whenever someone looks at me,

17:31.800 --> 17:34.290
I feel like many ants 
are crawling on my body.

17:35.710 --> 17:36.820
My natural sensitivity

17:38.060 --> 17:39.960
clogs my throat like this.

17:41.490 --> 17:43.510
But my mother never gave up on me.

17:43.900 --> 17:46.150
Xixi is great, good job!

17:46.830 --> 17:48.170
With her help,

17:49.010 --> 17:51.630
I gradually began trying to approach 
and get used to this world.

17:52.620 --> 17:53.950
But on that night...

17:53.950 --> 17:55.980
Go to a special education school...

17:56.130 --> 17:57.570
How can we afford this!

17:57.620 --> 17:59.240
What's the problem to 
let a girl stay at home?

17:59.300 --> 18:01.800
Learn to be a good wife and 
mother. That’s enough!

18:02.270 --> 18:03.500
Don't be like her mother.

18:03.720 --> 18:07.040
Getting a mouth full of 
sweet talks and flirting!

18:07.990 --> 18:09.880
From then on,

18:10.390 --> 18:15.180
I only feel safe when I 
cover myself up tightly.

18:17.720 --> 18:21.420
I also hate being a freak 
in the eyes of others!

18:22.860 --> 18:24.900
Sorry, I didn't mean that.

18:24.900 --> 18:26.000
Then

18:28.330 --> 18:29.880
promise me one more thing!

18:30.180 --> 18:31.490
What's wrong with her again?

18:34.070 --> 18:35.440
She drank too much Coke

18:35.440 --> 18:36.530
and wanna go to the restroom.

18:38.460 --> 18:39.660
OK, I'll take her there.

18:39.660 --> 18:41.010
Well,

18:41.380 --> 18:42.900
the situation is a bit special.

18:43.220 --> 18:45.840
She requests that I shall go with her.

18:50.890 --> 18:51.600
Alright then,

18:52.190 --> 18:53.050
walk from here

18:53.050 --> 18:55.000
turn left at the first passage and go 
along to the end, then on the right side.

18:55.000 --> 18:55.240
I'll go with you guys.

18:55.240 --> 18:55.930
Without knowing if she has control ability

19:00.200 --> 19:02.400
or how to use it,

19:02.400 --> 19:03.940
we still need more people to watch over her.

19:04.380 --> 19:05.820
Let's go, I'll lead the way.

19:07.830 --> 19:09.300
Come, I will go inside with you

19:18.040 --> 19:19.520
Wait a minute,

19:19.520 --> 19:20.060
I have a question.

19:20.830 --> 19:21.760
Can you answer me first?

19:22.320 --> 19:23.760
Sure

19:23.970 --> 19:24.450
These two siblings are quite strange.

19:24.940 --> 19:26.710
How could there be only a small section of the case-related information in the record?
These two siblings are quite strange.

19:27.140 --> 19:30.010
How could there be only a small section of 
the case-related information in the record?

19:30.380 --> 19:31.470
Where is the rest?

19:32.580 --> 19:35.220
Captain Xiao, How about I go take a look too?

19:35.440 --> 19:37.220
Is it okay for Officer Wang to go alone?

19:38.360 --> 19:39.960
She is known for being a tough woman.

19:40.270 --> 19:41.600
There are few male colleagues 
in the police force

19:41.600 --> 19:43.020
who can compete with her

19:43.620 --> 19:46.250
But it seems like Li Tianxi wants 
to whisper something to her

19:46.250 --> 19:46.980
Is that okay?

19:47.530 --> 19:48.410
I'm listening too.

19:48.890 --> 19:50.910
I really can't hear what 
this Li Tianxi is saying.

19:57.840 --> 20:00.980
Qian Jin, what?!

20:05.810 --> 20:07.770
What did you say? I can't hear you.

20:15.540 --> 20:16.670
Ask again.

20:18.400 --> 20:19.330
I'm asking.

20:23.210 --> 20:24.810
It was Qian Jin who handled this case?!

20:25.420 --> 20:27.390
I think something's wrong over there.

20:29.150 --> 20:30.110
Now think this way

20:30.370 --> 20:31.730
based on the time

20:31.730 --> 20:33.980
it's also exactly the year 
Qian Jin left the police force

20:44.320 --> 20:46.490
Why did you come at such a perfect timing?

20:47.330 --> 20:50.730
when I asked to go to the restroom?

20:51.520 --> 20:53.250
Have you been listening in the whole time?

20:53.410 --> 20:55.390
Damn, she found out!

20:57.610 --> 20:58.690
My fault.

20:59.000 --> 21:00.320
I shouldn't have let Wang 
Juan go there so early.

21:00.660 --> 21:01.380
I misjudged.

21:01.940 --> 21:03.240
I didn't expect her to be so smart.

21:04.060 --> 21:06.540
What is her relationship with Qian Jin?

21:18.630 --> 21:21.470
Could it be Qian Jin who 
set up the whole thing?

21:22.610 --> 21:23.920
What on earth does he want to do!

21:25.470 --> 21:27.940
Captain Xiao, I'm going check the restroom.

21:28.910 --> 21:30.100
I'll go with you.

21:31.420 --> 21:31.970
Wait!

21:37.480 --> 21:38.290
What did you say?!

21:38.440 --> 21:39.560
Liu Guang is missing?!

21:39.690 --> 21:41.180
Captain Xiao, I'm sorry.

21:41.480 --> 21:43.790
We broke in and found the window broken

21:44.040 --> 21:45.550
so we thought Mr. Lu had an accident

21:50.460 --> 21:53.010
We couldn't find him on the 
first floor or in his room.

21:57.120 --> 21:59.400
Okay, time's up!

22:06.740 --> 22:09.610
I won't lose so easily this time.

22:15.920 --> 22:17.860
Officer Wang! Cheng Xiaoshi!

22:18.240 --> 22:19.280
Are you in there?

22:21.890 --> 22:25.560
Officer Wang! Cheng Xiaoshi!

22:30.710 --> 22:31.550
Hello, Captain Xiao.

22:31.550 --> 22:32.930
There's no one in the 
women's restroom. They...

22:33.170 --> 22:34.190
I just checked the surveillance footage.

22:34.540 --> 22:36.540
They probably have escaped from 
the police station by now.

22:36.540 --> 22:37.330
How is that possible!

22:43.400 --> 22:45.360
Why did Wang Juan take them out?!

22:46.600 --> 22:49.120
Officer Wang? That doesn't make sense.

22:49.690 --> 22:51.010
What exactly happened?

22:51.170 --> 22:52.410
What about Cheng Xiaoshi?

22:52.410 --> 22:53.680
I'm also confused now.

22:54.280 --> 22:57.310
Anyway, we must not let them get away!
